## Returned owner transport

Output is NDJSON: one header, one result per input, one final summary. Each result
copies the complete input_witness and SHA256 of exact case UTF-8 bytes excluding
LF. The native_input_event_key contains actual state_address/procedure/invocation/
event ordinal/checkpoint. before/after copy actual typed state; actual_context
copies the exact flags, TimeStepZone and HT/opaque/AllHT orders used by the call.
No thermal expression, history seed, coefficient or expected endpoint is computed
by the observer. Binary64 is reconstructed from observed bits; class is checked
and actual returned bits/class are serialized without decimal replacement.

